  +getEntityPaths(): List<Class<? extends EntityPathBase<?>>>
}

LetterController ..> ReissueLetterListRequestDto : request body
LetterController ..> ReissueLetterListResponseDto : HTTP 200 response
LetterController --> ReissueLetterService
ReissueLetterService <|.. ReissueLetterServiceImpl

ReissueLetterServiceImpl --> SecurityUtil : authenticated login
ReissueLetterServiceImpl --> BulkPrintDataRepository : find letters and check prior DBD summons
IReissueLetterRepository <|-- BulkPrintDataRepository
IReissueLetterRepository <|.. IReissueLetterRepositoryImpl
ReissueLetterServiceImpl --> JurorRepository : fill missing reminder form codes
ReissueLetterServiceImpl --> LetterType : query rules, sorting and columns
ReissueLetterServiceImpl --> DataType : format response fields
ReissueLetterServiceImpl ..> ReissueLetterListResponseDto : constructs
IReissueLetterRepositoryImpl --> LetterType : form codes and projected fields
IReissueLetterRepositoryImpl --> DataType : query expressions and joins

note bottom of LetterController
  POST /api/v1/moj/letter/reissue-letter-list
  Bureau users only (@IsBureauUser)
  HTTP 200 with letter details
  HTTP 404 when no letters match
end note

note bottom of JurorRepository
  Used for SUMMONED_REMINDER rows
  with a missing form code.
  Prior DBD summons lookup occurs
  only for digital-by-default jurors.
end note

legend bottom
  Only public methods relevant to this endpoint are shown.
  BulkPrintDataRepository inherits findLetters from IReissueLetterRepository.
  Spring Data composes the custom implementation into the repository.
  DTO accessors, framework calls and private helpers are omitted.
  Listing is read-only; no letters are queued or sent.
endlegend

@enduml
